  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved employment opportunities for women and men in Saudi Arabia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the development of the Labour Market Strategy, ILO support this Biennium, the ILO will be providing direct support to the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development in developing relevant monitoring and evaluation frameworks and putting them into action to ensure the policy outcomes are delivered. Importantly, in early 2024, the ILO will support the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development (MHRSD for the update of the labour market strategy. Such work will ensure the development of an effective and evidence-based policy capable of addressing the main challenges facing the Saudi labour market.</narrative>
  </description>
